Description: JamBoard - a soundboard for streamers
 JamBoard is a cross platform soundboard. It plays audio clips to your
 speakers and to a virtual microphone so they show up in Discord, OBS
 or any other voice chat application.
 .
 It includes a text to speech engine based on Microsoft Edge neural
 voices, a URL importer that uses yt-dlp, an effects rack, and
 hardware routing for speaker, microphone and virtual device.
